# Planar Void: "Whenever another card is put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile that card." A resolved instant goes
# from the stack to its owner's graveyard (CR 608.2n), a card put into a graveyard from the stack; the trigger exiles it
# whichever graveyard it reached - Bot1's own Lightning Bolt and Bot2's Shock alike, since it is "a graveyard", not "an
# opponent's". Neither graveyard keeps a card and the Void itself stays.

